# L §5.14 The take is a fill over arcs: "Ties between arcs whose order changes a take are refused"; "Two outflows never
# share a part: two outflows tied for one part that can't cover both are refused"; A hole in a term: "Only the parts
# the take could reach under some reading of the holes merge".  a1's order is rank[k.owner], rank a hole.  It holds one
# part, the couple's 1 000.00; two buys of one day take 300.00 and 200.00.  Under every reading of rank each buy takes
# its amount from that part, which covers both, so the take is decided: a1 keeps 500.00 of the couple's
# (scratch/exp_r3.py) and the units the buys bring to u1 and u2 are the couple's by the leg read (10 and 5, carried
# through).  (Was: the take undecided, a1's rest and both arrivals hole parts; the migrator's t7_qa_qb, ask qa.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2021-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source src "test"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind funds: unit
kind couples: parties
kind persons: parties
kind invests: transfers
kind buys: event certain
  leg units: funds
  leg cash: DUK
kind cash_accounts: place one min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order rank[k.owner]
kind lots1: holdings
  owned by arrive
  step 0.0001
  takes k for w order rank[k.owner]
place a1: cash_accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..
place u1: lots1 idx lives 2021-01-01..
place u2: lots1 idx lives 2021-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..
place market: outside lives 2000-01-01..
input jb: observed
def rank[p in parties]: int = ?"which money leaves first?" at reader
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)
  rule bought beats community = m.cash.amount of p / m.cash.amount when m in buys

ask qa: bal(a1, 2025-12-31) of ania_tomek, bal(u1, 2025-12-31) of ania_tomek, bal(u2, 2025-12-31) of ania_tomek, bal(a1, 2025-12-31) of ania

version cast
  cite src
  known 2021-01-01
  funds + [idx] lives 2018-01-01..
  persons + [ania] lives 1991-03-14..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1989-07-02..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2016-09-10..

version open
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  opening[a1] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start
  opening[u1] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start
  opening[u2] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start

version j
  cite src
  governs 2025-01..2025-12
  known 2025-01-01
  covers a1, u1, u2
  jb[j1] = (on: 2025-02-01, kind: invests, leg cash from world to a1 amount 1000.00 DUK) "j1"
  jb[j2] = (on: 2025-03-01, kind: buys, leg units from market to u1 amount 10 idx, leg cash from a1 to market amount 300.00 DUK) "j2"
  jb[j3] = (on: 2025-03-01, kind: buys, leg units from market to u2 amount 5 idx, leg cash from a1 to market amount 200.00 DUK) "j3"
=== expect
qa: (500.00 DUK, 10 idx, 5 idx, 0.00 DUK)
...
